<title>FINLAND: Finnish Nov industrial production up 7.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Finnish Nov industrial production up 7.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish industrial production growth adjusted for working days accelerated to 7.2 percent year-on-year in November from 6.8 percent percent in October, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>		   Nov 1996    Oct 1996   Nov 1995</p>
<p>		   +7.2 pct    +6.8 pct   +3.4 pct</p>
<p>Five economists' average forecast was for a growth rate of 6.1 percent (range +6.0 - +6.3 pct).</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
